    "detailed_description": "<i>An Eternity Gone By</i> is a time-based adventure across a series of strange worlds, filled with fun and imaginative monsters for you to face. Use Mirai\u2019s telekinetic magic to launch the objects covering various worlds right back at the monsters inhabiting them\u2026 Revisit past levels decades later as you work your way to face the evil Spider Dragon: King of the Monsters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/346e1c6eecaa36639fd3b4e2322d0eb8.webp?t=1738958420\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br>It is said that every thirty years monsters descend upon Starblast Village. Everyone knows not to leave home during this event - everyone except for Mirai Starblazer. <br><br>That night, Mirai convinces her best friend Kako to sneak out and watch the stars. However, during their outing the two are ambushed by monsters and Kako is abducted and taken away to a mysterious world. Mirai ventures after her, not yet realizing just how long this journey will take\u2026<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/c4e198b617215dc475c3700b828eda02.webp?t=1738958420\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br>It will take more than one attempt for Mirai to save Kako. Mirai might not have enough time on the first attempt. And with every failed attempt, time will pass and Mirai and the worlds she visits will change.<br><br>Follow Mirai through the different phases of her life. With age comes new perspectives as well as new abilities on the battlefield!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/5be91fd3dcfd0aec7705e509c9f7babe.webp?t=1738958420\" width=600 height=50 /></span>Mirai isn\u2019t the type to attack with fireballs or lasers. Her weapons are the very objects that make up the world around her!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/7abcb92418daa6337a2599049e105508.poster.avif?t=1738958420\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/7abcb92418daa6337a2599049e105508.webm?t=1738958420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/7abcb92418daa6337a2599049e105508.mp4?t=1738958420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>See an orange? You can throw it! Is there a giant cake at the top of a mountain? Hurl it down at your enemies! The world is your plaything, and it\u2019s your only weapon against the waves of monsters you\u2019ll be fighting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/39e1a7f7d6ee67b7edf637d5199490a3.webp?t=1738958420\" width=600 height=50 /></span> All sorts of monsters inhabit this strange world Mirai finds herself in. Fight hordes of enemies to gain new skills that will help you on your journey!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/4c4845ae9709823bec99f0b1945c81ea.poster.avif?t=1738958420\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/4c4845ae9709823bec99f0b1945c81ea.webm?t=1738958420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/4c4845ae9709823bec99f0b1945c81ea.mp4?t=1738958420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Just don\u2019t linger too long. The portal to the next world won\u2019t stay open forever\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/41b0588fd95a3945946b14c3c5757745.webp?t=1738958420\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interesting and colorful handcrafted worlds to explore<br></li><li>Dozens of unique and silly monsters to face<br></li><li>A unique telekinetic fighting style featuring 100+ different objects to control.<br></li><li>A tense race against the clock in every level.<br></li><li>Upgrades and new abilities just waiting to be unlocked<br></li><li>Alternate aged versions of worlds previously explored<br></li><li>Dynamic and fun voiced lines from the protagonist throughout gameplay<br></li><li>Beautifully hand drawn and fully voice acted cutscenes</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/84f712bf24dc45c62191f108f56c4825.poster.avif?t=1738958420\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/84f712bf24dc45c62191f108f56c4825.webm?t=1738958420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/84f712bf24dc45c62191f108f56c4825.mp4?t=1738958420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
